          "body": "I upgraded Strawberry in my Windows VM to 5.40.0.1, which includes its own copy of CMake and was able to replicate the bad ZLIB_LIBRARY value. The current version of the MR should find a top-level \"Strawberry\" directory in any drive and correctly sets CMAKE_IGNORE_PREFIX_PATH.",
