      "title": "CMake: Ignore Strawberry Perl's prefix",
      "message": "CMake: Ignore Strawberry Perl's prefix\n\nStrawberry includes many components that are incompatible with our\nbuilds, including xsltproc and zlib. Find Perl early on and if it is\nStrawberry-flavored, ignore its prefix.\n\nFixes #20304\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2024-12-20T13:18:27.000-08:00",
      "committer_name": "Gerald Combs",
